OL,3,GNEWSAEssex Police misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Farage has accused Essex Police
OL,7,Fof "misleading" people about how many
OL,8,Fcrimes are committed by asylum seekers.
OL,10,FThe Reform UK leader said Chief
OL,11,FConstable Rachel Nolan was "completely
OL,12,Fwrong" to say nobody should be
OL,13,Fconcerned about criminality from
OL,14,Fmigrants housed at MDP Wethersfield,
OL,15,FEssex.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
