OL,3,GNEWSAEssex Police misleading on migrant
OL,4,Acrime - Farage
OL,5,
OL,6,FNolan said crime linked to the
OL,7,Faccommodation near Braintree was "very
OL,8,Flow", with 15 offences since it opened
OL,9,Fin 2023 in which a member of the public
OL,10,Fwas the victim and the suspect was
OL,11,Fidentified as, or alleged to be, a
OL,12,FWethersfield "service user".
OL,14,FA force spokesman said incidents
OL,15,Frelating to asylum seekers there
OL,16,F"remain low", but that it understood
OL,17,Fhow communities felt was "incredibly
OL,18,Fimportant".
